        "id": 1116939
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-04-19T14:29:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I wonder if we can just use unix timestamps for this, suppose that the build server is always ntp synced.",
      "parentUuid": "07b28f79_484bfed9",
      "revId": "ca0e82685989a08c6adaa52fc8d33546cd3bb1a2",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
